EmailTemplate.content:
Hello,

A qualified lead has been assigned to you for further engagement.

Applicant Details:
- Name: {!Lead.FirstName} {!Lead.LastName}
- Email: {!Lead.Email}
- Company: {!Lead.Company}
- Qualification Score: {!Lead.Qualification_Score__c}
- Qualification Result: {!Lead.Qualification_Result__c}

This lead has met the qualification criteria and is ready for the next stage of the process. Please reach out promptly.

Thank you,
Equity Builder Finance
